WEBVTT

00:01:43.250 --> 00:01:44.850
Time to eat!  Time to eat!

00:01:44.850 --> 00:01:46.210
Hey, where should we eat today?

00:01:47.560 --> 00:01:49.190
Brother!

00:01:49.190 --> 00:01:51.660
I brought lunch!

00:01:52.190 --> 00:01:55.050
Sumomo's special Salisbury steak lunch!

00:01:55.050 --> 00:01:56.690
Eat it all up, OK?

00:01:56.690 --> 00:01:57.520
Thanks.

00:01:57.520 --> 00:02:01.030
Sumomo-chan, since you're here, why don't you eat with us?

00:02:01.030 --> 00:02:02.740
Sure, I'd be happy to!

00:02:04.080 --> 00:02:05.930
This Salisbury steak is great!

00:02:05.930 --> 00:02:08.610
Your omelet is good, too, Hime-chan!

00:02:08.610 --> 00:02:11.350
I'm so jealous, Yuuma.

00:02:11.350 --> 00:02:16.280
You get to eat Sumomo-chan's love-filled lunches every day!

00:02:16.280 --> 00:02:18.730
Love-filled?  No way...

00:02:18.730 --> 00:02:20.650
Now don't be all sulky.

00:02:20.650 --> 00:02:23.290
You can have some of mine.

00:02:23.290 --> 00:02:26.730
What am I going to do with love from a guy?

00:02:26.730 --> 00:02:31.050
A few fun moments with friends in the afternoon.

00:02:31.050 --> 00:02:35.710
Lately boxed lunches have been enjoying a quiet boom at our school.

00:02:37.110 --> 00:02:39.550
By the way, where's Anri-chan?

00:02:39.550 --> 00:02:40.500
Dunno...

00:02:51.300 --> 00:02:53.270
This is pretty bad.

00:02:53.940 --> 00:02:55.260
This is pretty bad.

00:03:00.580 --> 00:03:03.730
I have to think of some way to attract customers.

00:03:04.540 --> 00:03:07.420
I have to think of some way to make some money.

00:03:09.580 --> 00:03:11.040
I know!

00:03:11.040 --> 00:03:12.230
Nice working with you!

00:03:15.120 --> 00:03:20.210
<b>Oasis</b>

00:03:26.480 --> 00:03:28.370
Good morning!

00:03:28.370 --> 00:03:32.360
Cafeteria Oasis is having its grand reopening today!

00:03:32.360 --> 00:03:34.830
Anri-chan, what are you doing?

00:03:34.830 --> 00:03:36.430
Can't you tell by looking?

00:03:36.430 --> 00:03:38.600
A part-time job!

00:03:38.600 --> 00:03:40.570
Oh, excuse me!

00:03:40.570 --> 00:03:44.120
I just started working at the in-school cafeteria.

00:03:44.120 --> 00:03:45.330
Drop in!

00:03:45.330 --> 00:03:48.050
You'd better stop by or I won't forgive you!

00:03:48.720 --> 00:03:50.100
Excuse me!

00:03:50.100 --> 00:03:51.830
Oasis is having a grand reopening!

00:03:51.830 --> 00:03:55.670
Come to think of it, I haven't been to the cafeteria for a while.

00:03:56.510 --> 00:03:59.960
But I brought a boxed lunch today...

00:04:02.610 --> 00:04:04.910
What's this?

00:04:05.630 --> 00:04:09.870
I gave out all those advertisements!  Why isn't anybody coming?

00:04:10.760 --> 00:04:20.830
I figured if I had a cute waitress invite customers,
a few people might come, but I guess I was too naive.

00:04:20.830 --> 00:04:22.340
Don't worry!

00:04:22.340 --> 00:04:30.320
I swear, as the future number 1 mage of this academy, that I, Hiiragi Anri, will bring customers in!

00:04:32.610 --> 00:04:34.580
Brother!

00:04:35.160 --> 00:04:36.730
Here's your boxed lunch!

00:04:36.730 --> 00:04:39.840
It's Sumomo's special marinated chicken lunch today!

00:04:43.780 --> 00:04:44.960
A chicken?

00:04:46.490 --> 00:04:48.010
What happened?

00:04:48.440 --> 00:04:50.610
M-My lunch?!

00:04:52.260 --> 00:04:54.270
At least cook the thing.

00:04:54.270 --> 00:04:56.470
Who the hell would eat a frog raw?!

00:04:56.470 --> 00:04:58.480
My lunch turned into a frog!

00:04:58.480 --> 00:05:01.430
What kind of nonsense is that?

00:05:08.120 --> 00:05:09.000
Jun!

00:05:09.770 --> 00:05:11.450
Wake up!

00:05:29.070 --> 00:05:30.770
What's going on?

00:05:30.770 --> 00:05:33.430
The problem is,

00:05:33.430 --> 00:05:38.250
no matter what the cause, the lunches of we growing children who endured...

00:05:38.250 --> 00:05:41.310
...our morning classes for this moment have been lost!

00:05:43.660 --> 00:05:49.900
As I thought, our only remaining option is our school's worst bread: raw ham strawberry bread!

00:05:49.900 --> 00:05:52.300
What should we do, Brother?

00:05:52.910 --> 00:05:53.860
Oh yeah!

00:05:53.860 --> 00:05:57.790
Anri-chan started a part-time job at Oasis!

00:05:57.790 --> 00:06:00.150
She asked us to go say hello!

00:06:00.150 --> 00:06:01.740
Oh?  Let's go!  Let's go!

00:06:01.740 --> 00:06:02.720
You, too, Kohinata-kun!

00:06:02.720 --> 00:06:05.240
No, I think I'm fine.

00:06:06.780 --> 00:06:08.670
Oh, come on!

00:06:08.670 --> 00:06:13.260
Haruhi-chan is inviting you.  If you refuse, God will smite you.

00:06:13.260 --> 00:06:14.410
Come on!

00:06:14.410 --> 00:06:16.550
Let's go!  Let's go!

00:06:16.550 --> 00:06:18.260
Hey, let me go!

00:06:18.260 --> 00:06:22.220
Maybe Kohinata-kun doesn't like the cafeteria?

00:06:22.730 --> 00:06:25.180
Did I do something wrong?

00:06:28.160 --> 00:06:29.770
Yuuma-kun!

00:06:29.770 --> 00:06:31.570
You finally came!

00:06:31.570 --> 00:06:34.170
I never seen you here before!

00:06:34.170 --> 00:06:36.720
Hey, everybody is watching!

00:06:36.720 --> 00:06:40.070
Then you want to do it where nobody can see us?

00:06:40.070 --> 00:06:43.150
Nobody's saying that!

00:06:43.150 --> 00:06:46.540
It's bad if you're all over me.

00:06:48.120 --> 00:06:49.410
He's freaking out.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:51.350
Yup, he's freaking out.

00:06:51.350 --> 00:06:56.360
Mom, I think you should stop with the overly warm welcome...

00:06:57.280 --> 00:06:59.890
OK, I'll introduce you!

00:06:59.890 --> 00:07:04.830
The manager of Oasis, Kohinata Otoha-san, is Yuuma's mom!

00:07:04.830 --> 00:07:06.790
His mom?

00:07:07.210 --> 00:07:08.780
Hello, everyone!

00:07:08.780 --> 00:07:10.480
You're Haruhi-chan?

00:07:10.480 --> 00:07:12.540
I've heard all about you from my son!

00:07:12.540 --> 00:07:16.420
He was telling me how he was in the same class as a beautiful genius from the School of Magic.

00:07:16.420 --> 00:07:17.470
Mom!

00:07:17.470 --> 00:07:19.360
He's blushing!

00:07:19.360 --> 00:07:21.510
I'll get some water.

00:07:21.510 --> 00:07:24.850
This is why I didn't want to come to Oasis...

00:07:25.790 --> 00:07:28.860
I see, so that's why.

00:07:33.320 --> 00:07:34.680
Welcome.

00:07:35.850 --> 00:07:37.450
Hiiragi-san!

00:07:37.450 --> 00:07:39.190
We came to say hello!

00:07:39.190 --> 00:07:40.450
It looks good on you!

00:07:40.450 --> 00:07:41.870
Of course it does!

00:07:41.870 --> 00:07:43.460
Let me take your order.

00:07:43.460 --> 00:07:44.980
I'll take the A lunch.

00:07:44.980 --> 00:07:46.190
I'll take the B lunch.

00:07:46.190 --> 00:07:47.490
Curry for me.

00:07:47.490 --> 00:07:48.310
Neapolitan.

00:07:48.310 --> 00:07:50.000
I'll have the oyako-don.

00:07:50.910 --> 00:07:52.140
Coming right up!

00:07:52.140 --> 00:07:54.080
Five A lunches!

00:07:56.250 --> 00:07:58.360
It's annoying when everybody picks different stuff!

00:07:58.360 --> 00:08:00.140
Order the A lunch.

00:08:00.140 --> 00:08:01.420
That's crazy.

00:08:01.420 --> 00:08:04.090
Is she really gonna be OK doing this?

00:08:04.720 --> 00:08:07.050
Here's your beef curry.

00:08:07.050 --> 00:08:09.140
Huh?  But I didn't order that...

00:08:09.640 --> 00:08:10.760
I'm sorry!

00:08:10.760 --> 00:08:12.220
Can I have some water?

00:08:12.220 --> 00:08:13.780
Yes, right away!

00:08:13.780 --> 00:08:15.280
Is my A Lunch ready yet?

00:08:15.280 --> 00:08:17.210
Y-Yes, right away!

00:08:17.870 --> 00:08:20.150
What are you doing?

00:08:20.150 --> 00:08:21.650
I-I'm sorry.

00:08:21.650 --> 00:08:23.390
Let's go.

00:08:28.190 --> 00:08:30.310
Wh-Why did this happen?

00:08:30.310 --> 00:08:34.230
Anri-chan, I don't know if you're really cut out for the service business.

00:08:34.230 --> 00:08:36.870
It's not a question of being suited for it or not.

00:08:36.870 --> 00:08:43.190
I was hired to bring back customers to Oasis, and for that end I completed mission after mission!

00:08:43.190 --> 00:08:44.490
Mission?

00:08:44.490 --> 00:08:47.180
No way, then that trouble back there...

00:08:51.130 --> 00:08:52.800
It was Anri-chan who did it?

00:08:52.800 --> 00:08:54.920
I have no idea what you're talking about.

00:08:54.920 --> 00:08:58.030
Are you trying to say I used magic to turn lunches into animals?

00:08:59.190 --> 00:09:00.520
She's confessing.

00:09:01.460 --> 00:09:03.200
Don't blame Anri-chan!

00:09:03.200 --> 00:09:04.520
Mom?

00:09:04.520 --> 00:09:07.360
It's all my fault as manager.

00:09:07.360 --> 00:09:11.830
I'll have to go the extra mile and provide extra service for everyone!

00:09:14.360 --> 00:09:16.640
Hey, Mom...

00:09:22.300 --> 00:09:25.980
I want to study abroad when I graduate.

00:09:25.980 --> 00:09:26.770
Study abroad?

00:09:26.770 --> 00:09:32.840
I want to study real magic at a European Magic Research Center, and become the best in Japan.

00:09:32.840 --> 00:09:36.740
No, the world!

00:09:36.740 --> 00:09:39.020
So that's why you took a part-time job?

00:09:39.020 --> 00:09:41.830
Yeah.  Maybe I was wrong.

00:09:41.830 --> 00:09:45.490
Waitressing isn't a good job for me.

00:09:45.490 --> 00:09:47.060
That's not true!

00:09:48.520 --> 00:09:51.060
Try your best and keep on working.

00:09:51.060 --> 00:09:53.730
I'm behind you all the way!

00:09:54.520 --> 00:09:55.710
Haruhi...

00:10:02.820 --> 00:10:08.390
Now then, I, Watarase Jun,
shall show you how to be a waitress!

00:10:08.890 --> 00:10:10.370
Thank you very much.

00:10:10.370 --> 00:10:12.470
Why Jun?

00:10:12.470 --> 00:10:16.220
I hear she's had a lot of service jobs.

00:10:16.770 --> 00:10:18.440
Service jobs?

00:10:20.740 --> 00:10:23.380
Welcome back, Master!

00:10:23.380 --> 00:10:27.330
No, even better...

00:10:30.080 --> 00:10:31.770
Welcome!

00:10:31.770 --> 00:10:36.230
He's doing jobs like that even though he's a guy?

00:10:36.590 --> 00:10:37.710
You there!

00:10:37.710 --> 00:10:39.800
No weird fantasies!

00:10:39.800 --> 00:10:42.400
The most important part of being a waitress is the smile.

00:10:42.400 --> 00:10:45.320
Smile everywhere and at all times!

00:10:45.320 --> 00:10:46.440
Yes!

00:10:46.440 --> 00:10:47.830
Welcome.

00:10:47.830 --> 00:10:48.790
What can I get for you?

00:10:49.750 --> 00:10:51.560
One order of your smile...

00:10:52.450 --> 00:10:53.970
What the heck is that?

00:10:53.970 --> 00:10:56.430
Anri-chan, smile, smile!

00:10:56.430 --> 00:10:57.770
Right, right!

00:10:57.770 --> 00:10:59.910
Would you like anything else?

00:10:59.910 --> 00:11:03.230
I'd like to drink morning coffee with you...

00:11:05.150 --> 00:11:07.100
Calm down, Anri-chan!

00:11:07.100 --> 00:11:09.250
No, he will pay!

00:11:10.190 --> 00:11:14.240
A waitress must relay orders quickly and accurately!

00:11:14.240 --> 00:11:15.040
OK!

00:11:15.040 --> 00:11:17.060
I'll have the katsudon and some orange juice.

00:11:17.060 --> 00:11:18.580
I'll have cream soda.

00:11:18.580 --> 00:11:19.970
Peperoncino and an American.

00:11:21.480 --> 00:11:23.460
Three Americans.

00:11:23.460 --> 00:11:26.900
Write abbreviations on your pad.

00:11:26.900 --> 00:11:28.990
Cream Soda can be CS.

00:11:28.990 --> 00:11:30.880
Orange Juice is OJ.

00:11:30.880 --> 00:11:31.930
I see.

00:11:34.320 --> 00:11:40.380
I think it's also important to create a unique menu that you can only get at Oasis.

00:11:40.380 --> 00:11:42.480
This five-grain curry is delicious!

00:11:43.340 --> 00:11:47.180
This natural herb and free-range chicken sauté is very healthy!

00:11:47.700 --> 00:11:50.240
Wh-What are you making?

00:11:50.240 --> 00:11:52.160
Special Stamina Soup!

00:11:52.160 --> 00:11:55.130
Customers will love this!

00:12:02.900 --> 00:12:06.050
I just add this secret powder at the end...

00:12:10.040 --> 00:12:11.210
What was that?

00:12:26.540 --> 00:12:28.490
Here you are.

00:12:30.070 --> 00:12:32.500
You're getting better.

00:12:33.690 --> 00:12:37.710
This store still has its biggest problem remaining.

00:12:37.710 --> 00:12:39.060
Biggest...

00:12:39.060 --> 00:12:40.540
...problem?

00:12:40.540 --> 00:12:46.040
Yes, the problem that is unwittingly driving customers away.

00:12:46.040 --> 00:12:47.200
That is...

00:12:47.200 --> 00:12:49.610
...the waitress's style!

00:12:53.170 --> 00:12:55.050
What do you mean?!

00:12:55.050 --> 00:12:57.280
Calm down and listen to the end!

00:12:57.280 --> 00:12:58.870
What's the name of this store?

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:00.350
Oasis.

00:13:00.350 --> 00:13:01.820
That's right!

00:13:01.820 --> 00:13:03.860
This is the Academy's oasis.

00:13:03.860 --> 00:13:08.300
This is a place of rest, for students to relax for a moment during their hours of study.

00:13:08.300 --> 00:13:16.120
But the waitresses just put an apron over their uniform, which reminds them that this is a school!

00:13:16.120 --> 00:13:17.270
I see.

00:13:17.270 --> 00:13:18.100
I see.

00:13:18.100 --> 00:13:19.000
I see.

00:13:19.000 --> 00:13:19.810
Yeah.

00:13:19.810 --> 00:13:21.370
Yeah...

00:13:21.370 --> 00:13:23.360
And so...

00:13:23.360 --> 00:13:27.830
In order to give them an escape from their everyday lives, the waitresses must abandon their uniforms, 

00:13:27.830 --> 00:13:30.150
and be naked except for their apron!

00:13:30.150 --> 00:13:34.220
Patriot Missile Kick!

00:13:41.110 --> 00:13:44.480
Hachi's such an idiot.

00:13:46.960 --> 00:13:48.670
Uniforms, huh?

00:13:56.250 --> 00:13:58.810
That's magic cloth!

00:13:58.810 --> 00:14:01.000
Anri-chan, what are you planning to do?

00:14:01.000 --> 00:14:03.600
This is something I wore when I was a kid,

00:14:03.600 --> 00:14:05.580
I'm modifying it and making it into a maid outfit.

00:14:06.560 --> 00:14:12.200
The waitress has to be cute or the customers won't be happy.

00:14:12.200 --> 00:14:14.680
I have to do everything I can.

00:14:14.680 --> 00:14:15.740
Ouch!

00:14:15.740 --> 00:14:17.220
Shall I help?

00:14:17.220 --> 00:14:21.150
I can do it without your help.

00:14:21.150 --> 00:14:25.400
But If you really want to, I'll let you help me.

00:14:31.200 --> 00:14:32.670
Welcome!

00:14:35.110 --> 00:14:36.840
Good afternoon!

00:14:36.840 --> 00:14:38.120
Can I take your order?

00:14:39.500 --> 00:14:41.100
Thank you!

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:43.610
Anri-chan, coffee!

00:14:43.610 --> 00:14:45.220
Coming right up!

00:14:45.220 --> 00:14:47.110
I'll have an large A lunch!

00:14:47.110 --> 00:14:48.570
Understood!

00:14:48.570 --> 00:14:51.700
Anri-chan's uniform is cute.

00:14:51.700 --> 00:14:53.250
They're doing really well.

00:14:53.250 --> 00:14:56.040
I was right after all.

00:14:56.040 --> 00:14:58.310
Cheers to maid outfits.

00:14:58.310 --> 00:15:00.620
Men are idiots.

00:15:00.620 --> 00:15:01.740
You don't get to say that.

00:15:01.740 --> 00:15:03.740
It's not just the clothes.

00:15:03.740 --> 00:15:07.740
Anri-chan's been training hard to be a waitress since last night.

00:15:07.740 --> 00:15:11.370
And all these customers are here, so...

00:15:11.370 --> 00:15:12.670
Yeah.

00:15:12.670 --> 00:15:14.390
You may be right.

00:15:14.390 --> 00:15:17.930
Your mom's happy to have so many people here!

00:15:17.930 --> 00:15:19.050
Yeah!

00:15:19.050 --> 00:15:19.880
But...

00:15:19.880 --> 00:15:22.370
It's definitely all boys.

00:15:22.370 --> 00:15:23.790
Don't worry!

00:15:23.790 --> 00:15:26.330
I've taken steps to take care of that.

00:15:26.800 --> 00:15:28.800
Where shall we have lunch?

00:15:28.800 --> 00:15:30.510
Let me see...

00:15:31.570 --> 00:15:32.500
Wait.

00:15:34.240 --> 00:15:36.090
I feel danger.

00:15:36.090 --> 00:15:37.600
I can see it.

00:15:37.600 --> 00:15:40.690
A black fog clouds your future.

00:15:40.690 --> 00:15:44.640
A terrible fate awaits you.

00:15:45.670 --> 00:15:47.640
Well, I don't know...

00:15:47.640 --> 00:15:49.960
No need to fear.

00:15:49.960 --> 00:15:54.020
Your lucky item is Oasis's five-grain curry.

00:15:54.020 --> 00:15:58.320
Eat it and the fog will clear, and you will spend your days in peace.

00:15:59.890 --> 00:16:02.460
Thank you very much!

00:16:03.680 --> 00:16:06.940
<i>Hey, that's a tricky thing you're doing.</i>

00:16:06.940 --> 00:16:09.610
Not at all.

00:16:09.610 --> 00:16:13.280
I am merely offering guidance to lost sheep.

00:16:17.660 --> 00:16:19.970
It's getting crowded.

00:16:19.970 --> 00:16:21.890
Maybe too crowded.

00:16:21.890 --> 00:16:26.590
Yes, we have customers waiting.  So if you're done, get going.

00:16:26.590 --> 00:16:28.400
Uhm, can I order?

00:16:28.400 --> 00:16:31.010
Yes, just a second.

00:16:31.010 --> 00:16:33.110
Hey, is my five-grain curry done yet?

00:16:33.110 --> 00:16:34.320
Yes, right away!

00:16:34.320 --> 00:16:36.110
Excuse me!

00:16:36.110 --> 00:16:37.570
Right!

00:16:37.570 --> 00:16:39.560
Five-grain curry, please!

00:16:39.560 --> 00:16:40.720
Right away!

00:16:40.720 --> 00:16:42.760
Anri-chan, need any help?

00:16:42.760 --> 00:16:45.480
Thanks, but I'm fine.

00:16:45.480 --> 00:16:46.290
But...

00:16:46.290 --> 00:16:48.290
This is my job.

00:16:48.290 --> 00:16:51.740
I couldn't possibly ask for any more from you.

00:16:51.740 --> 00:16:52.910
Anri-chan...

00:16:52.910 --> 00:16:54.200
It's fine.

00:16:54.200 --> 00:16:56.790
Once I decide to get serious, this is nothing.

00:16:56.790 --> 00:16:58.600
Let's go, Paella.

00:16:58.600 --> 00:17:00.150
<i>Yes, Anri-sama.</i>

00:17:00.750 --> 00:17:01.970
Hiiragi!

00:17:01.970 --> 00:17:03.650
What are you going to do?

00:17:03.650 --> 00:17:04.640
No way.

00:17:04.640 --> 00:17:07.270
Oasis is a place of rest.

00:17:07.270 --> 00:17:09.690
This is the only way to keep everyone smiling!

00:17:10.130 --> 00:17:12.460
<i>On Perselas Du Arsas!</i>

00:17:12.460 --> 00:17:16.660
<i>Estalias Alc Deluteras Vi Seis Ha!</i>

00:17:30.270 --> 00:17:31.850
Amazing...

00:17:33.230 --> 00:17:34.600
This is...

00:17:34.600 --> 00:17:37.690
Special summoning magic:  Cross Mirage!

00:17:37.690 --> 00:17:41.760
If I decide I want to do it,
magic like this is nothing at all!

00:17:41.760 --> 00:17:44.240
Now, get to work!

00:17:44.240 --> 00:17:45.570
Right!

00:17:45.570 --> 00:17:48.550
Welcome!  Welcome, customers!  Welcome!

00:17:48.550 --> 00:17:49.780
Amazing.

00:17:49.780 --> 00:17:52.610
I want to take one home...

00:17:53.700 --> 00:17:55.580
Incoming order!

00:17:55.580 --> 00:17:58.160
One five-grain curry and a free-range chicken lunch!

00:17:58.160 --> 00:17:59.270
OK!

00:17:59.270 --> 00:18:00.300
Two five-grain curries!

00:18:00.300 --> 00:18:01.300
Got it!

00:18:01.300 --> 00:18:03.570
An ice au lait, hot, and an ice tea!

00:18:03.570 --> 00:18:04.490
OK.

00:18:04.490 --> 00:18:07.020
Two five-grain curries, four iced coffees.

00:18:07.950 --> 00:18:09.380
Welcome!

00:18:09.380 --> 00:18:10.560
Let me take your order.

00:18:10.560 --> 00:18:14.990
Welcome!  Welcome!  Here you are!  Welcome!

00:18:15.360 --> 00:18:17.210
Wow, Anri-chan!

00:18:17.210 --> 00:18:22.340
Controlling special summoning magics is hard; but you're doing it so well.

00:18:22.340 --> 00:18:26.460
Welcome!  Welcome to Oasis!  Here's your five-grain curry!

00:18:26.460 --> 00:18:31.800
Here's your five-grain curry!

00:18:31.800 --> 00:18:34.000
I didn't ask for this much!

00:18:34.000 --> 00:18:36.950
How about a water refill?

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.970
How about a water refill?

00:18:39.970 --> 00:18:46.820
Here's your five-grain curry!

00:18:46.820 --> 00:18:51.770
How about a water refill?

00:18:51.770 --> 00:18:53.490
What's going on?

00:18:53.490 --> 00:18:55.250
Her control is failing.

00:18:55.250 --> 00:18:57.450
Where are you taking all those?

00:19:00.870 --> 00:19:02.540
Here you go!

00:19:09.340 --> 00:19:12.460
Anri-chan, cancel the spell right away!

00:19:12.460 --> 00:19:13.050
Got it!

00:19:15.240 --> 00:19:17.510
Disappear, my copies!

00:19:24.650 --> 00:19:26.990
I won't lose to a fake!

00:19:26.990 --> 00:19:29.040
No, you're the fake!

00:19:29.040 --> 00:19:30.480
I'm the original!

00:19:30.480 --> 00:19:32.720
No, I'm the original!

00:19:32.720 --> 00:19:34.250
Shut up, fake!

00:19:34.250 --> 00:19:35.860
What, you want to fight?

00:19:38.800 --> 00:19:44.230
<i>On Elmesas Luk Arsas Estalias Arc Eluteras, banish!</i>

00:19:49.070 --> 00:19:52.290
This is what happens when you rely too much on magic!

00:19:52.290 --> 00:19:53.580
That's not true!

00:19:53.580 --> 00:19:58.040
I'm going to believe in the power of magic, in Anri-chan's feelings.

00:19:59.760 --> 00:20:02.520
Anri-chan, stop the spell right now.

00:20:02.520 --> 00:20:03.950
It's impossible, I can't.

00:20:03.950 --> 00:20:05.350
You can do it!

00:20:05.350 --> 00:20:09.500
You're going to be the greatest mage in the world, right?

00:20:10.150 --> 00:20:11.250
I got it.

00:20:11.250 --> 00:20:12.310
I'll try!

00:20:13.200 --> 00:20:17.540
<i>On Elmesas Luk Arsas Estalias Arc-!</i>

00:20:19.390 --> 00:20:21.550
Y-Yuuma!

00:20:23.600 --> 00:20:31.500
<i>On Elmesas Luk Arsas Estalias Arc Eluteras, banish!</i>

00:20:31.500 --> 00:20:33.980
What?  You wanna fight?

00:20:49.920 --> 00:20:51.220
Anri-chan!

00:20:58.510 --> 00:21:01.750
Don't space out like that, Kamisaka Haruhi...

00:21:01.750 --> 00:21:04.030
H-How do you know my name?

00:21:04.030 --> 00:21:05.560
I know you.

00:21:05.560 --> 00:21:09.020
You gave the speech on behalf of the incoming students, didn't you?

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:10.180
Y-Yes...

00:21:10.180 --> 00:21:12.130
I'm Hiiragi Anri.

00:21:12.130 --> 00:21:17.780
I heard you entered this school with the highest grades, but don't get cocky.

00:21:17.780 --> 00:21:23.040
I'll be the one to shine in the role of No. 1 at Mizuhosaka Academy School of Magic.

00:21:25.350 --> 00:21:27.200
Wh-What's so funny?

00:21:27.200 --> 00:21:31.670
I'm sorry.  Everybody I met was so formal and distant that I was kind of uneasy.

00:21:31.670 --> 00:21:34.380
But thanks to you, I'm not nervous anymore.

00:21:34.880 --> 00:21:37.540
Nice to meet you, Anri-chan.

00:21:37.540 --> 00:21:39.240
Y-Yeah.

00:21:42.580 --> 00:21:44.000
You're awake.

00:21:45.100 --> 00:21:46.490
What is this?

00:21:46.490 --> 00:21:48.490
The power of your magic.

00:21:51.970 --> 00:21:55.940
A shower of cherry blossoms appearing out of nowhere...

00:21:55.940 --> 00:22:02.340
It was such a fantastic enough sight that everyone forget they were at school.

00:22:04.620 --> 00:22:07.620
What happened to Anri-chan after that?

00:22:15.660 --> 00:22:16.880
Welcome!

00:23:55.080 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>Next Episode</b>

00:23:55.590 --> 00:23:57.720
I'm Kamisaka Haruhi.  That's all.

00:23:57.720 --> 00:24:01.080
See, if I waste time on introductions,

00:24:01.080 --> 00:24:03.960
then I won't have time to talk about what's important, like the next episode.

00:24:03.960 --> 00:24:06.190
So I just said, "That's all."

00:24:06.190 --> 00:24:09.750
But this is taking up all our time, too.

00:24:09.750 --> 00:24:12.050
Then let me get started.

00:24:12.050 --> 00:24:17.400
In the next episode, Takamine Koyuki-senpai,
a senior at the School of Magic, will have a big role.

00:24:17.400 --> 00:24:19.210
It's:  The Missing Tama-chan.

00:24:17.970 --> 00:24:25.040
<b>The Missing Tama-chan</b>

00:24:19.210 --> 00:24:21.710
What?  Tama-chan's going missing?

00:24:21.710 --> 00:24:25.030
If he goes missing, he can't have a big role...
